\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, O my God, the promise seal.
\par This mountain, sin, remove;
\par Now in my fainting soul reveal
\par The virtue of Thy love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I want Thy life, Thy purity,
\par Thy righteousness, brought in;
\par I ask, desire, and trust in Thee,
\par To be redeemed from sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Anger and sloth, desire and pride,
\par This moment be subdued;
\par Be cast into the crimson tide
\par Of my Redeemer's blood!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Saviour, to Thee my soul looks up,
\par My present Saviour Thou!
\par In all the confidence of hope,
\par I claim the blessing now.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. 'Tis done! Thou dost this moment save,
\par With full salvation bless;
\par Redemption through Thy blood I have,
\par And spotless love and peace.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

